{:edb/db-before-t 1412 :edb/db-after-t 1413 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534725 50 #inst "2026-10-08T05:10:34.259Z" 13194139534725 true] [17592186068786 1020 #edb/ref 17592186305859 13194139534725 true] [17592186068786 1020 #edb/ref 17592186305863 13194139534725 true] [17592186068787 1020 #edb/ref 17592186305845 13194139534725 true] [17592186068787 1020 #edb/ref 17592186305852 13194139534725 true] [17592186305845 1017 #edb/ref 17592186305846 13194139534725 true] [17592186305845 1089 "q-160769" 13194139534725 true] [17592186305845 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534725 true] [17592186305845 1100 "What is the value of \n $f(s)=\\operatorname{tan}⁡s\\,i+\\operatorname{cot}⁡s\\,j-\\,k$ at $s=\\frac{\\pi }{4}?$" 13194139534725 true] [17592186305845 1113 #uuid "f2833ab6-0677-5bf5-af9f-0c2e9b6cd957" 13194139534725 true] [17592186305845 1145 "To evaluate, we substitute at $s=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$  into the function, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\,i+\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\,j-k \\\\  & =1\\,i+1\\,j-k \\\\  & =i+j-k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the value of  $f(s)$ at $s=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$  is $i+j-k.$" 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305847 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305848 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305849 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305850 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305851 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1041 "selection" 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1104 #edb/ref 17592186305849 13194139534725 true] [17592186305846 1110 #uuid "2f9bd623-c233-52bd-ad8c-954448a4b583" 13194139534725 true] [17592186305847 1034 "-i-j-k" 13194139534725 true] [17592186305847 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534725 true] [17592186305847 1111 #uuid "621a3006-4293-5eb5-8d1d-3b223aa9e3aa" 13194139